// Hands the player the Lance on spawn, in both hands, with ammo.
//
// This pk3 replaces nothing -- no weapon slot stolen, no existing class
// touched -- specifically so it can be loaded on top of another mod without
// fighting it. The cost of that is you would otherwise have to `give` it from
// the console every single time you load a map, which is intolerable when the
// whole point of the load is to look at the beam.
//
// So it is granted instead of substituted: nothing else loses anything, and it
// is simply there when you spawn.
gameinfo
{
	AddEventHandlers = "LNC_Startup"
}
